5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’d like to understand the actual financial scope before we commit. What does the ledger say about this year’s development allocation?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I’m less interested in the money than the results. Did any of our previous initiatives actually change patient outcomes, or just add paperwork?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’m curious how new programs affect our daily rosters. Which teams would realistically absorb the extra workload without burning out?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the physical space. Can we actually fit another program into the rooms and parking without everything seizing up?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about what happens after the ribbon is cut. Where do these new arrangements usually break down in the second year?,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the focus on outcomes, Shion. But without knowing the financial ceiling, we can't even define what is realistically buildable.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ceiling is irrelevant if the floor is broken. We need to know if the previous attempts actually worked before we spend a single coin.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I hear you, but rosters are where the real strain shows. I’d like to see the staffing records to understand the pressure points.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, that makes sense. But I’m also worried about the booking screens. If the system can’t handle the new flow, we’ll just create more chaos for everyone.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, the screens are only part of it. I’ve seen good plans fail because the people running them quietly stopped.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shizue, that is a fair point. I will look into the ledger and the regional fund tariffs to see what we can actually afford.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ledger is just a number. I need to know if the work actually stuck. I’ll check the readmission figures and the booking system records.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Kenji, the booking system is vital, but I need to see the staffing review to understand where the pressure actually sits.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, I agree. I’ll check the rooms and parking coverage, plus what the booking system actually records.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I will look into the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
