22,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I’ll review the therapy and midwifery staffing, plus the ward nursing vacancies.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’ll check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage, plus what the booking system records.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
